```
Incident resolved — 2026-08-10
Root cause: entry-count.sh:5 counted `^## ` (section headings) instead of the dated `### YYYY-MM-DD` entry marker its own comment names, so it printed 2 against 3 real entries.
Risk: Medium   Protected zone touched: No
Files changed: logs/scripts/entry-count.sh
Verification: real invocation now prints 3 (was 2), matching independent enumeration; scratch-copy growth check +1 entry → 4.
